mmary":"Structuring the delivery plan","content":"I’m organizing the response around three projects, with estimated current-versus-target completion and clearly labeled assumptions because the actual repositories aren’t available for direct inspection. Each project will receive an execution-ready TaskPack, Definition of Done, task cards, visual and asset guidance, accessibility and Windows verification, packaging steps, tests, and merge handoff requirements. WORK-LAB will include both Super Entry architecture options.","chunks":[],"finished":true}],"source_analysis_msg_id":"58ac5e86-9cb2-43bc-95f8-454c73cfcdbc"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"is_reasoning"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"bd771b63-a862-4d51-ab44-186a03cb84fa","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1790754419.119059,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":"Worked for 5m 4s"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"reasoning_ended"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"9693ab07-efd3-5b1f-a77d-342340ef2edd","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":null,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":""},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":0.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_title":"Generated report on 执行摘要"},"recipient":"all","channel":null}],"source_searches":[]}